    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287">

                <pb facs="0481" n="411" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg411"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Campbell</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 33.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 1, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Proceed with as much despatch as possible to the residence of President Juarez of
                    Mexico, and enter upon your mission. Earnestly urge clemency to Maximilian, and
                    other prisoners of war, if necessary.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis D. Campbell,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., New Orleans.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
